   Input Batches: 1
   Input Rows: 10
   Output Rows: 10
   ->  Custom Scan (TessSort) (actual rows=10.00 loops=1)
         Sort Key: i DESC
         Sort Method: top-N in memory
         Memory Usage: N kB
         Input Batches: 3244
         Input Rows: 200000
         Rows Rebuilt: 3
         ->  Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on sort_seq (actual rows=200000.00 loops=1)
               Batch Size: 64
               Batches: 3244
               Pages: 1081
               Deformed Datums: 400000
               Restarted Datums: 0
(17 rows)

